  "bitsurance":["https://bitsurance.io/","bitsurance bietet Versicherungsschutz für selbst verwahrte Bitcoin in Hardware-Wallets. Versicherungsbedingungen und technische Verwahrung betreffen unterschiedliche Risiken und Verantwortlichkeiten. Interessenten sollten Deckungsereignisse, Ausschlüsse, Nachweise, Limits, Schadensprozess und Verwahrungsanforderungen prüfen. Eine Police schützt weder vor Kursverlusten noch ersetzt sie sichere Schlüsselverwaltung.","bitsurance offers insurance cover for self-custodied Bitcoin held in hardware wallets. Policy terms and technical custody address different risks and responsibilities. Prospective customers should review insured events, exclusions, evidence, limits, claims process and custody requirements. A policy neither protects against price movements nor replaces sound key management.","Bitcoin-Versicherung;Self-Custody;Hardware-Wallets;Deckung;Schadenprozess;Nachweise;Risikomanagement","Bitcoin insurance;Self-custody;Hardware wallets;Coverage;Claims;Evidence;Risk management","Finanzen;Treasury;Versicherung;Recht;Security;Compliance;Risikomanagement","Finance;Treasury;Insurance;Legal;Security;Compliance;Risk management"],
